SUMMARY:Zillicoah Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Beer Drinkers\, Happy Hours & Bar Hoppers\nI know th
 at it's a holiday week and many of you will be away or busy\, but I will b
 e at Zillicoah Brewery on Riverside Dr on Tuesday night. It's just North o
 f the junction of Broadway and Riverside Dr at the UNC exit off I-26. Rive
 rside Dr and Broadway\, are both friendlier drives than I-26 at 5:30\, but
  it's only one exit North of 240 if you use I-26. I really like this brewe
 ry\, and I think that many of you will too. It sets right on the river\, a
 nd may remind some of you of the old Bywater\, with nice outdoor grounds a
 nd picnic tables on the lawn. We will be meeting inside\, but you'll get t
 he feel of the place. I hope to see some of you there on Tuesday night. Th
 ey do advertise a food truck on site.
